@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+# Spike 0001 code
+
+Harness for `openintent/experiments/spikes/0001-built-in-extension-injection/report.md`. None of this is product code, and it is never merged: it exists only to answer that report's question and it lands beside the report as `evidence.patch`.
+
+## Files
+
+| Path | What it is |
+| --- | --- |
+| `runs/` | Raw output of every run, one file per run. The report cites these. Label `A` is candidate A under Node 26.8.2, `A2610` candidate A under Node 26.10.0, `B` candidate B. |
+| `findings/A.md`, `findings/B.md` | Per-candidate conclusions, each marked proved or inferred. |
+| `c7-measure.sh` | C7: added and removed lines in upstream-owned files against `eda5a402a`, and byte parity of the ported directory against rpiv-mono `8403bb09`. |
+| `harness/scripted-provider.ts` | Apparatus loaded with `-e`: a faux provider that calls `ask_user_question`, then records the tool result. |
+| `harness/pty_drive.py` | Drives an interactive program in a pseudo-terminal and renders screens with pyte. |
+| `harness/c1-tui.sh` | C1 through `pty_drive.py`. `PI_BIN` selects the candidate's bin. |
+| `harness/c2-rpc.mjs` | C2: RPC driver that answers the `select` request. |
+| `harness/c3-c5-sdk.mjs` | C3, C4 and the SDK half of C5 from compiled output; the second argument selects the SDK entry. |
+| `harness/c3-registry-detail.mjs` | C3 detail: extension-level registration against `getAllTools()`, and runtime enabling. |
+| `harness/c4-direct-import.mjs` | Supporting: a bare-specifier SDK import with and without a fork entry imported first. |
+| `harness/c5-cli.sh` | C5, CLI half: `--list-models` and `-p` against the fixture provider. |
+| `harness/c6-fenced.sh` | C6: C1's flow under `pi-fence run --profile general`, then the launch's violations journal. Needs `settings.json` without the `rpiv-mono` package. |
+| `candidates/A.patch`, `candidates/B.patch` | Each candidate's implementation against `eda5a402a`, excluding the ported package, the harness and generated locks. The branch head holds B; `A.patch` preserves A. |
+
+The branch head holds candidate B. Apply `candidates/A.patch` to a clean `eda5a402a` checkout, plus the ported package, to rebuild candidate A.
+
+## Running it
+
+From the worktree root, after `npm install --ignore-scripts` and `npm run build`:
+
+```
+spike/c7-measure.sh <label>
+spike/harness/c1-tui.sh <label>                      # PI_BIN=packages/distribution/bin/pi.mjs for B
+node spike/harness/c2-rpc.mjs <label>                # same PI_BIN rule
+node spike/harness/c3-c5-sdk.mjs <label> [entry]     # packages/distribution/index.mjs for B
+node spike/harness/c3-registry-detail.mjs <label> [entry]
+spike/harness/c5-cli.sh <label>
+node spike/harness/c4-direct-import.mjs <label> bare-only|after-entry=<entry>
+```
+
+No harness calls a real model: every turn runs on a faux provider.
